{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovation. Expansion. Prosperity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Confiner of PhaigeX Megacorp, you'll be deployed to hyperspace frontiers tasked to contain the rising rogue A.I. threat. Pilot advanced Phaige units, execute high-risk commissions, and secure the future through tech, territory, and triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f3076cefba9e0a46690b97c3be6d27d9.poster.avif?t=1760332283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f3076cefba9e0a46690b97c3be6d27d9.webm?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f3076cefba9e0a46690b97c3be6d27d9.mp4?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where skill meets corporate firepower.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through hostile sectors packed with enemy ships, dodging missile fire and striking back with precision. Designed for intense chases and split-second turns, your mastery of speed and weaponry will decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/31d4532848a466e25c5a4959ed712e97.poster.avif?t=1760332283\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/31d4532848a466e25c5a4959ed712e97.webm?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/31d4532848a466e25c5a4959ed712e97.mp4?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Arsenal. Shape Your Ship.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your Phaige unit with modular weapons and ship upgrades that suit your tactics. From precision long-range barrages to missile spams, your loadout and ship systems will define how you fight \u2014 and how you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/7432b944737b724344b6a2892fccbf6f.poster.avif?t=1760332283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/7432b944737b724344b6a2892fccbf6f.webm?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/7432b944737b724344b6a2892fccbf6f.mp4?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE LIST:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a Confiner and take on daring, high-risk commissions under PhaigeX command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide array of modules to fine-tune and transform your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your resources\u2014ammo and energy are limited, and every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command multiple PhaigeX ships and pair them with specialized support crafts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unique weapons by combining parts, creating new behaviors and effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Towards a brighter future,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f833047ff1bc0ac09e52ba212fc1a193.avif?t=1760332283\" width=400 height=105 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909480?t=1760332283","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909480?t=1760332283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/34ab67a800a3ed1cb4cfee84cbcb7d4e3784c1ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760332283","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/34ab67a800a3ed1cb4cfee84cbcb7d4e3784c1ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760332283","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4001260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovation. Expansion. Prosperity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Confiner of PhaigeX Megacorp, you'll be deployed to hyperspace frontiers tasked to contain the rising rogue A.I. threat. Pilot advanced Phaige units, execute high-risk commissions, and secure the future through tech, territory, and triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f3076cefba9e0a46690b97c3be6d27d9.poster.avif?t=1760332283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f3076cefba9e0a46690b97c3be6d27d9.webm?t=1760332283\" type=\"video/webm;